# Pipeline run output and per-room fix-loop evidence: regenerable from
# README.md's documented commands against a tester's own captures --
# never ship pre-baked results, so a fresh clone starts with nothing run.
output/
results/fix_loop/before/
results/fix_loop/after/

# Same reasoning: these docs/ files are written by scripts/run_benchmark.py,
# scripts/generate_device_matrix.py, scripts/run_head_to_head.py directly
# from media/ + media/ground_truth/ -- regenerate via scripts/reproduce_all.py.
docs/benchmark_report.md
docs/benchmark_results.json
docs/device_matrix.md
docs/timing.md
docs/head_to_head_report.md
docs/head_to_head_table.md
docs/head_to_head_table.csv
